        "TileImage": "$($repository 9047da86-e90f-4a2b-b38a-b634f8c7868c).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Our client for this mission worked in R&amp;D for hazmat suits, until he was fired for not meeting schedule deadlines due to what his employer called &quot;overcaution&quot;. Furious, and eager to prove his tenacity was merited, he has contracted us to eliminate the Ether Virus lab team via drowning -- this will prove the inadequate sealing in the suits following his dismissal.\r\rDue to the high security in the field lab, you will likely need to sicken the team to isolate them. Good luck.",
